==Battleground==
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

